{"about_the_game":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Build Your Own Farm Under the Mysterious World Tree!</h2>Oreplant is an idle cozy simulation game. <br>Join 'Finn' and 'Maru' to breathe life back into a faded world and create your own cozy space.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3377860/extras/b34d51e393b97059e5dd7358b663d4c5.poster.avif?t=1768203885\" width=1170 height=218 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3377860/extras/b34d51e393b97059e5dd7358b663d4c5.webm?t=1768203885\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3377860/extras/b34d51e393b97059e5dd7358b663d4c5.mp4?t=1768203885\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br><br><strong>\ud83e\udd16 Join Forces with Useful Robots</strong><br>Cute automation robots help you grow minerals!<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3377860/extras/257bf5ad3f2303eda66f311c13738543.poster.avif?t=1768203885\" width=640 height=360 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3377860/extras/257bf5ad3f2303eda66f311c13738543.webm?t=1768203885\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3377860/extras/257bf5ad3f2303eda66f311c13738543.mp4?t=1768203885\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br><br><strong>\ud83e\udda6 Relaxing Fishing with 'Dambi' the Otter</strong><br>Enjoy a moment of peace by the water with your lovely partner, 'Dambi' the otter.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3377860/extras/4eda7b41860951ae95fad87ceeb568cc.poster.avif?t=1768203885\" width=640 height=360 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3377860/extras/4eda7b41860951ae95fad87ceeb568cc.webm?t=1768203885\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3377860/extras/4eda7b41860951ae95fad87ceeb568cc.mp4?t=1768203885\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br><br><strong>\ud83c\udf73 Delicious Cooking and Buffs</strong><br>Cook various dishes with harvested crops and fish.<br>Completed dishes provide useful buffs to help characters in their adventure.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3377860/extras/e57b78348e74fae60abea46f0f6a1955.poster.avif?t=1768203885\" width=640 height=360 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3377860/extras/e57b78348e74fae60abea46f0f6a1955.webm?t=1768203885\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3377860/extras/e57b78348e74fae60abea46f0f6a1955.mp4?t=1768203885\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br><br><strong>\ud83c\udfe1 Decorate Your Own Farm</strong><br>Customize your farm freely with various items and backgrounds to create your unique style.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3377860/extras/bb23a4e274e6b40281b147df3ff6f4f8.poster.avif?t=1768203885\" width=640 height=360 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3377860/extras/bb23a4e274e6b40281b147df3ff6f4f8.webm?t=1768203885\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3377860/extras/bb23a4e274e6b40281b147df3ff6f4f8.mp4?t=1768203885\" type=\"vide